2B armour.tests:
node test/run.mjs: all 19 suites pass with every old baseline identical: fingerprint (36 entries), traces (35), handling (25) and driving (14). Other suites: combat.test 22/22 (combat.json identical), mp.test 47/47, ground.test 89/89, catalogue 61/61, physics 52/52, flutter 21/21, us4 16/16, shapes 11/11, rwr 34/34, core 19/19, flight 10/10. aim, gmode and groundai are placeholders at 1/1.

test/armour.test.js: 77/77. It covers:
- prism, round and box entry and exit faces;
- a turned turret at ψ = 90° hit on its front by a shot from the side, a raised barrel's box, and nested turned turrets (the fast frames match Aim.unpose to 1e-9);
- hitFirst;
- effective thickness and normalisation at 0–55° for AP, APFSDS and APCR, with penetration exactly at the threshold;
- ricochet windows for 5 shell types (400 seeded shots each, within 0.08), the bounced round, overmatch, composite against HEAT, and p.mm;
- penetration against range for all 19 kinetic shells, within 2% of the drag law;
- HEAT against skirts, slats, reactive bricks and tandem charges;
- the same result for the same shot, fragments stopped by a fuel cell, the APHE burst, the path formula, structure shares, unarmoured parts on an old plane;
- crew lists and replacement, the knock-out threshold, a one-man crew, both seat swaps;
- cook-off odds (0.9, 0.58, 0.95, 0.27, all within 0.07) and blow-out;
- the turret toss, repairs only while stopped and 6 s after a hit, engine fire, idempotent broken modules, a hull at 0 hp, spawn protection;
- HE over an open-top turret against a box turret, blastK classes, blast distance to a turned turret;
- the legacy table for bullets, rockets, missiles and bombs;
- owner skip, wrecks, peer copies, darts through old planes, the proximity fuze and its end-of-life burst, the gTop skip, berm shots from 300 m, the coarse ground;
- peer shell checks, summary, partFX, old explode hp for hp on every plane, car and helicopter template, combat.json (runs combat.test.js);
- multiplayer: old messages unchanged, new fields, the 32-row cap, wrecks refused, hostile and broken module rows (bad id, index, NaN, Infinity, 1e9 clamped), friends refused, the hit arc, our shell on a ghost sent as hits;
- timing, logged: 68.8 µs a penetration, 0.29 ms a main-gun shell, 0.14 ms an autocannon round.

